#28: 
Since many temperature sensors come "preconfigured" with a lower precision, people are stuck at that precision when running on a kernel based device (unlike the Dallas 1Wire library for e.g. Arduino, which supports writing the configuration/scratchpad). This patch adds write support for the scratchpad/precision registers via w1_slave sysfs.

